Arabic Pattern Matrix™ Documentation
Open Source Template Documentation for GitHub

Vision
Arabic Pattern Matrix™ adalah platform pembelajaran Bahasa Arab berbasis Visual Pattern Recognition, Neuroscience, Gamification, dan AI untuk membawa pembelajar dari nol hingga mampu membaca kitab kuning.
Core Features
• Neural Pattern Recognition
• Visual Memory Engine
• Arabic Root Explorer
• Pattern Recognition
• Native Audio
• Gamification (XP, Badge, Boss)
• AI Learning Assistant
Learning Roadmap
Stage 1: Neural Recognition (Level 1–20)
Stage 2: Sharaf Engine (21–40)
Stage 3: Nahwu Visual (41–60)
Stage 4: Kitab Reading (61–80)
Stage 5: Advanced Analysis (81–100)
